# The family repos live inside this dir but are their own git repos.
#
# 🚨 The rice's checkout is still `nebelhaus/` here, and that line stays until
# `bench` moves. §3.1 decided the end state — `hausfold/` the platform,
# `hausfold.co/` the site, each dir named for its own repo — but today
# `cmd_clone` still plants the SITE at `$ROOT/hausfold`, `FAMILY` still spells
# the rice `nebelhaus`, and `$ROOT/hausfold` holds a stale clone of the
# archived `hausfold/website`. Retiring `/nebelhaus/` here is step 3 of
# hausfold-rename.md §3.3's checklist, not step 1: do it out of order and the
# entire rice checkout shows up untracked in this tree, one `git add -A` away
# from being committed into the workshop.
/hausfold/
/hausfold.co/
/holt/
/nebelhaus/
/nebelung/
/pounce/
/perch/
/org-profile/
/homebrew-tap/
/web/.wrangler/
.DS_Store

